  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/P1030123.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">La sede de la Mancomunidad Espad&aacute;n Mijares en Tales ha acogido este lunes y martes un curso de manipulaci&oacute;n de fitosanitarios, tras el cual algo m&aacute;s de 20 hombres han podido solicitar el correspondiente carnet. Del 2 al 30 de junio se realizar&aacute; un curso de monitoraje de tiempo libre.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursfitosanitarismancomunitat/p1030123.jpg\" alt=\"p1030123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursfitosanitarismancomunitat/p1030124.jpg\" alt=\"p1030124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursfitosanitarismancomunitat/p1030125.jpg\" alt=\"p1030125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursfitosanitarismancomunitat/p1030126.jpg\" alt=\"p1030126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursfitosanitarismancomunitat/p1030127.jpg\" alt=\"p1030127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursfitosanitarismancomunitat/p1030128.jpg\" alt=\"p1030128\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
